new class                                              purpose
PndEmcWaveformWriteoutBuffer                           used to take care of all waveforms in time-based simulation.
PndEmcWaveformRingSorter 
PndEmcWaveformSorterTask                               used to produce pileup waveforms when condition is satisfied.
PndEmcFpgaPar                                          access to FPGA parameters setup.
PndEmcCorrBump                                         used to analysis a bump, for all digis in this bump, 
                                                       if their timestamps fail to match, they will be removed, 
                                                       and the bump will be remake.
PndEmcDigiCalibrator                                   calibrate digi timestamps, the calibrated time is used as a reference event time,
                                                       so we can group digis with closed timestamps.
PndEmcAnalysis                                         a helper class, used to save trees into tuples, we can 
                                                       judge whether each class works well or not.
                                                       

